OL,9,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,10,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,11,     G1600, Florence. At a lavish
OL,12,     GMedici wedding, Jacopo Peri'd
OL,13,     GEuridice introdces a radical new
OL,14,     Gidea: drama told entirely through
OL,15,     Gmusic. This is the birth of opera.
